WEBVTT

00:01:28.538 --> 00:01:31.663
the building block nutrients
of growth and development,

00:01:31.704 --> 00:01:35.496
manipulate how we feel and behave.

00:01:36.621 --> 00:01:40.621
Amino acids contain the precursors
to neurotransmitters,

00:01:40.663 --> 00:01:43.871
the chemical messengers
that carry signals between neurons,

00:01:43.913 --> 00:01:47.871
affecting things like mood, sleep,
attentiveness, and weight.

00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:52.038
They're one of the reasons we might feel
calm after eating a large plate of pasta,

00:01:52.079 --> 00:01:55.871
or more alert after a protein-rich meal.

00:01:55.913 --> 00:01:58.663
The complex combinations
of compounds in food

00:01:58.704 --> 00:02:03.579
can stimulate brain cells to release
mood-altering norepinephrine,